WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.400
Founder: Brother — what is blocking you from staying consistent in Lagos?

00:03.400 --> 00:06.800
Client: Work, traffic, and food. I need a home plan I can keep.

00:06.800 --> 00:10.400
Founder: Short home sessions, local plates, and a simple weekly rhythm.

00:10.400 --> 00:13.000
Client: That makes sense. I can start without an expensive gym.

00:13.000 --> 00:15.100
Founder: Exactly. Start this week — RepForge keeps you on track.
